### 2 — Serve the Agent Download from Next.js

#### [NEW] `src/app/api/agent/download/route.ts`
A Next.js route that serves `dist/PrintivaAgent.exe` as a binary download with the correct `Content-Disposition` header. Falls back to a redirect to GitHub Releases if the binary isn't built locally.

