---

### 4 — PowerShell Installer Script (Optional but Recommended)

#### [NEW] `dist/Install-PrintivaAgent.ps1`
A one-click PowerShell installer that:
1. Copies `PrintivaAgent.exe` to `%LOCALAPPDATA%\PrintivaAgent\`
2. Creates a Desktop shortcut
3. Registers the agent as a Windows Startup item (via registry `HKCU\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run`)

> [!NOTE]
> This makes the agent auto-start with Windows so shop owners don't need to remember to run it manually.

